,626100,552900,704200,1180700,1125500,1179000,1598800]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.kawanfood.com","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","employees":869,"city":"Klang","summary":"Kawan Food Berhad, an investment holding company, manufactures, trades in, distributes, and sells frozen food products. The company primarily offers parathas, flatbread, pastries under brands Kawan and KG Pastry, frozen vegetable and fries, pizza, ready-to-eat products and curry, snacks, glutinous rice ball, oriental buns, spring roll, chapatti, mini bun, and samosa pastry under the Kawan, KG Pastry, Passion Bake, and Veat brands. The company distributes its products through distributorship, direct sales, e-commerce, and retailers and wholesalers. In addition, it involves investment in properties and rental of trucks; manufacturing, trading, distributing, importing, and exporting of concentrated syrups of various flavors, as well as frozen fruit juices; and provision of information technology services. The company operates in Malaysia, North America, the rest of Asia, Europe, Oceania, and Africa. Kawan Food Berhad was founded in 1960 and is based in Klang, Malaysia.","zh":"Kawan Food Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，主要从事冷冻食品的制造、贸易、分销和销售，成立于1960年，总部位于马来西亚巴生，业务覆盖马来西亚、北美、亚洲其他地区、欧洲、大洋洲和非洲。","lines":["冷冻面点与糕点：生产并销售 parathas、flatbread、chapatti、pastries、samosa pastry 等，以 Kawan 和 KG Pastry 品牌面向分销商、零售商和批发商。","冷冻蔬菜与薯条：提供冷冻蔬菜和薯条产品，通过分销、直销、电商及零售批发渠道销售。","即食食品与咖喱：销售披萨、即食产品、咖喱、小吃、糯米球、东方包、春卷、迷你包等，覆盖 Kawan、KG Pastry、Passion Bake 和 Veat 品牌。","浓缩糖浆与冷冻果汁：制造、贸易、分销及进出口各种口味的浓缩糖浆和冷冻果汁。","其他业务：包括物业投资、卡车租赁以及信息技术服务。"],"lines_en":["Frozen pastries and breads: manufactures and sells parathas, flatbread, chapatti, pastries, and samosa pastry under Kawan and KG Pastry brands to distributors, retailers, and wholesalers.","Frozen vegetables and fries: offers frozen vegetable and fries products sold through distributorship, direct sales, e-commerce, and retailers and wholesalers.","Ready-to-eat products and curry: sells pizza, ready-to-eat products, curry, snacks, glutinous rice ball, oriental buns, spring roll, mini bun, and samosa pastry under Kawan, KG Pastry, Passion Bake, and Veat brands.","Concentrated syrups and frozen fruit juices: manufactures, trades, distributes, imports, and exports concentrated syrups of various flavors and frozen fruit juices.","Other operations: includes property investment, truck rental, and information technology services."]}}